      "backend": null,
      "hardware_label": "RTX 3080",
      "notes": "Sparse MoE: 8B total, ~1B active per token, which is why decode is far above what an 8B dense model manages on this card. Fully GPU-resident at 128K context in 6546 MiB, leaving ~3 GB spare on a 10GB card. Measured on an RTX 3080 10GB. Decode is the MEDIAN of 3 reps, not the best. Prompt is deliberately non-repetitive (repeated filler inflates decode on speculative setups by ~25%) and ignore_eos is set so output token count is identical across runs. Peak VRAM 6546 MiB with 212 MiB host-shared; elevated host-shared only indicates spill when the decode rate drops with it.",
